{"ordinal":14334,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452505542658","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_0907e82","source":"Wheelchair: Но эти ошибки приводят к очень страшным последствиям.","target":"Wheelchair: Dar greșelile astea au urmări cumplite.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14335,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452505542657","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_00e9c6d","source":"Wheelchair: Людям, конечно, свойственно ошибаться.","target":"Wheelchair: Firește, e omenește să greșești.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14336,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452505542656","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_04e97ab","source":"Wheelchair: Может, все они одинаково верно указывают на Гостя?","target":"Wheelchair: Poate toate indică la fel de sigur că cineva e Musafir?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14337,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452501348361","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_03a980a","source":"Wheelchair: Если… если ты не доверяешь этому признаку, то как я могу им доверять?","target":"Wheelchair: Dacă… dacă tu nu ai încredere în semnul ăsta, cum să am eu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14338,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452501348360","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_061ab27","source":"Wheelchair: ...","target":"Wheelchair: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14339,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452501348359","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_029dd06","source":"Wheelchair: Ну да, да. А что, да, да?","target":"Wheelchair: Păi da, da. Dar ce tot spun, „da, da”?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14340,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452501348358","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_044904f","source":"Wheelchair: ...","target":"Wheelchair: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
