{"ordinal":14342,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452501348356","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Death_0566dbd","source":"Teacher: …","target":"Teacher: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14343,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452501348355","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Death_0a93fdd","source":"Teacher: Наконец-то это закончится…","target":"Teacher: În sfârșit, se va termina…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14344,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452501348354","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Ears_DontShoot_0639a8d","source":"Teacher: Простите, пожалуйста…","target":"Teacher: Iertați-mă, vă rog…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14345,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452501348353","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Ears_DontShoot_0af6e0b","source":"Teacher: Ей…","target":"Teacher: Ei…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14346,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452501348352","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Ears_DontShoot_08d2e2a","source":"Teacher: Но теперь…","target":"Teacher: Dar acum…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14347,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452497154059","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Ears_DontShoot_0f1fbb3","source":"Teacher: Я иногда трогаю мочки ушей и вспоминаю, как одна девочка обожала мои серёжки… Хотела такие же, когда вырастет.","target":"Teacher: Uneori îmi ating lobii urechilor și-mi amintesc de o fetiță căreia îi plăceau tare mult cerceii mei… Voia și ea unii la fel când avea să crească.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14348,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452497154058","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Photo_DontShoot_0c17448","source":"Teacher: И в памяти остаются только изуродованные лица, полные боли, страха и непонимания…","target":"Teacher: Iar în amintire nu mai rămân decât chipuri desfigurate, pline de durere, frică și nedumerire…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14349,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452497154057","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Photo_DontShoot_08645ef","source":"Teacher: Но чем больше проходит времени, тем слабее становятся эти воспоминания…","target":"Teacher: Dar, pe măsură ce trece timpul, amintirile astea slăbesc tot mai mult…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14350,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452497154056","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Photo_DontShoot_0f65c72","source":"Teacher: Я пыталась запомнить лица детей, их голоса, их смех…","target":"Teacher: Am încercat să țin minte chipurile copiilor, vocile lor, râsetele lor…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14351,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452497154055","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Armpit_DontShoot_068eb2f","source":"Teacher: Я помню, как говорила детям: «Нужно быть чистыми, чтобы не болеть». А теперь понимаю… Не грязь страшнее всего и не болезнь. А люди…","target":"Teacher: Îmi amintesc cum le spuneam copiilor: „Trebuie să fim curați ca să nu ne îmbolnăvim.” Acum înțeleg… Nu murdăria și nici boala sunt cele mai înspăimântătoare. Ci oamenii…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14352,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452497154054","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Eyes_DontShoot_0cb0948","source":"Teacher: Я всё думала… Если бы я смогла выбить дверь… Если бы нашла другой путь… Но теперь я лишь закрываю глаза — и снова вижу этот пожар.","target":"Teacher: M-am tot gândit… Dacă aș fi putut sparge ușa… Dacă aș fi găsit altă cale… Dar acum e de ajuns să închid ochii și văd iar incendiul.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14353,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452497154053","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Hands_DontShoot_05c606f","source":"Teacher: Зачем вообще стараться, если кто-то, у кого больше силы, больше власти, всё равно решит за тебя…","target":"Teacher: De ce să te mai străduiești, dacă cineva mai puternic, cu mai multă autoritate, tot va hotărî în locul tău…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14354,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452497154052","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Hands_DontShoot_0b607f1","source":"Teacher: А теперь… теперь это всё так… бессмысленно.","target":"Teacher: Iar acum… acum totul pare atât de… lipsit de sens.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14355,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452497154051","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Hands_DontShoot_0fba54d","source":"Teacher: Раньше эти руки заплетали детям косички, перевязывали ссадины, учили завязывать шнурки…","target":"Teacher: Cândva, mâinile astea împleteau cosițele copiilor, le pansau zgârieturile, îi învățau să-și lege șireturile…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14356,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452497154050","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Teeth_DontShoot_021f332","source":"Teacher: Простите…","target":"Teacher: Iertați-mă…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14357,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452497154049","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Teeth_DontShoot_0dc7860","source":"Teacher: А теперь… теперь это всё кажется таким…","target":"Teacher: Iar acum… acum toate astea par atât de…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14358,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452497154048","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Teeth_DontShoot_05b4f1f","source":"Teacher: Когда учила детей чистить зубы, я говорила им, что белоснежная улыбка – это красиво. Они смеялись, показывали мне свои маленькие зубки.","target":"Teacher: Când îi învățam pe copii să se spele pe dinți, le spuneam că un zâmbet cu dinți albi ca zăpada e frumos. Ei râdeau și-mi arătau dințișorii lor.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-364.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14359,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452492959754","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Ears_Gun_0b43385","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14360,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452492959753","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Ears_Gun_029acde","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14361,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452492959752","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Ears_Gun_026a93a","source":"Teacher: Думаете, пуля спасёт от боли? Очень надеюсь на это…","target":"Teacher: Credeți că un glonț mă va scăpa de durere? Sper din tot sufletul…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-365.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14362,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452492959751","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Photo_Gun_0e02590","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
