{"ordinal":14368,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452492959745","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Eyes_Gun_04567eb","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14369,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452492959744","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Eyes_Gun_0927892","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14370,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452488765450","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Eyes_Gun_0fbbe20","source":"Teacher: Если бы вы видели, какие картины стоят у меня перед глазами… Вы бы не раздумывая нажали на курок, если у вас осталась хоть капля сострадания…","target":"Teacher: Dacă ați vedea imaginile care nu-mi ies din minte… Ați apăsa pe trăgaci fără să stați pe gânduri, dacă v-a mai rămas măcar un strop de milă…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-365.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14371,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452488765449","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Hands_Gun_0659362","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14372,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452488765448","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Hands_Gun_08703ff","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14373,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452488765447","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Hands_Gun_04c2b31","source":"Teacher: Ну же… Почему медлите? Эти руки больше никому не помогут.","target":"Teacher: Haideți… De ce ezitați? Mâinile astea nu mai pot ajuta pe nimeni.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-365.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14374,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452488765446","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Teeth_Gun_0dd23e7","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14375,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452488765445","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Teeth_Gun_07c9c5d","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14376,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452488765444","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Teeth_Gun_00f096f","source":"Teacher: Хотите добить то, что осталось? Что ж… я даже не удивлюсь.","target":"Teacher: Vreți să puneți capăt și la ce-a mai rămas? Ei bine… nici măcar nu m-ar mira.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-365.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14377,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452488765443","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Ears_0c34b60","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14378,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452488765442","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Ears_0a7ba79","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14379,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452488765441","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Ears_025eb98","source":"Teacher: Но мои уши всегда воспалялись, и я перестала.","target":"Teacher: Dar urechile mi se inflamau mereu și am încetat să-i port.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-365.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14380,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452488765440","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Ears_01b9630","source":"Teacher: Раньше я носила серёжки… Маленькие, с камушками. Дети говорили, что они блестят, как звёзды.","target":"Teacher: Înainte purtam cercei… Mici, cu pietricele. Copiii spuneau că străluceau ca stelele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-365.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
