{"ordinal":14389,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452484571137","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Armpit_0dda76b","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14390,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452484571136","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Armpit_06f53c8","source":"Teacher: Только вот… их уже не научишь. Ничему…","target":"Teacher: Numai că… pe ei nu-i mai poți învăța nimic. Niciodată…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-365.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14391,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452480376842","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Armpit_0c75e38","source":"Teacher: Привычка, наверное. Когда ты ухаживаешь за детьми, привыкаешь быть аккуратной. Учишь их мыться, чистить зубки…","target":"Teacher: Din obișnuință, probabil. Când ai grijă de copii, te obișnuiești să fii îngrijită. Îi înveți să se spele, să-și perie dințișorii…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-365.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14392,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452480376841","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Armpit_021840b","source":"Teacher: ...","target":"Teacher: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-365.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14393,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452480376840","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Armpit_06da366","source":"Teacher: Что, простите?.. Вы уверены, что это обязательно?.. Ох уж эти признаки…","target":"Teacher: Poftim?.. Sunteți sigur că e necesar?.. Of, semnele astea…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-365.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14394,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452480376839","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Eyes_0d9a552","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14395,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452480376838","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Eyes_01f6324","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14396,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452480376837","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Eyes_06cf6f2","source":"Teacher: Мне до сих пор страшно закрывать глаза. Я боюсь увидеть лица… Их беспомощные, обгоревшие лица…","target":"Teacher: Încă mi-e teamă să închid ochii. Mi-e frică să nu le văd chipurile… Chipurile lor neajutorate, arse…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-365.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14397,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452480376836","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Eyes_0d1e928","source":"Teacher: Как искали меня глазами, надеясь, что я спасу их… Это было невыносимо…","target":"Teacher: Cum mă căutau din priviri, sperând că o să-i salvez… Era de nesuportat…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-365.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14398,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452480376835","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Eyes_0fe272c","source":"Teacher: Я… я видела, как это случилось. Как малыши прижимались друг к другу, пока огонь полз к ним…","target":"Teacher: Eu… eu am văzut cum s-a întâmplat. Cum cei mici se strângeau unii în alții, în timp ce focul se apropia de ei…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-365.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14399,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452480376834","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Teacher_Eyes_01c4232","source":"Teacher: ...","target":"Teacher: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-365.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
